Terminals which are not used

   COMMA


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: VOID MAIN LPAREN RPAREN block

    2 block: LBRACE stmt_list RBRACE

    3 stmt_list: stmt stmt_list
    4          | /* empty */

    5 stmt: declaration
    6     | assignment
    7     | conditional
    8     | loop
    9     | block

   10 declaration: type ID SEMICOLON
   11            | type ID ASSIGN expr SEMICOLON
   12            | VAR ID ASSIGN expr SEMICOLON

   13 type: INT_TYPE
   14     | DOUBLE_TYPE
   15     | BOOL_TYPE
   16     | STRING_TYPE

   17 assignment: ID ASSIGN expr SEMICOLON

   18 if_start: IF LPAREN expr RPAREN

   19 conditional: if_start block

   20 @1: /* empty */

   21 conditional: if_start block @1 ELSE else_part

   22 else_part: block
   23          | conditional

   24 @2: /* empty */

   25 @3: /* empty */

   26 loop: WHILE @2 LPAREN expr RPAREN @3 block

   27 expr: or_expr

   28 or_expr: or_expr OR and_expr
   29        | and_expr

   30 and_expr: and_expr AND equality_expr
   31         | equality_expr

   32 equality_expr: equality_expr EQ relational_expr
   33              | equality_expr NEQ relational_expr
   34              | relational_expr

   35 relational_expr: relational_expr LT additive_expr
   36                | relational_expr GT additive_expr
   37                | relational_expr LE additive_expr
   38                | relational_expr GE additive_expr
   39                | additive_expr

   40 additive_expr: additive_expr PLUS multiplicative_expr
   41              | additive_expr MINUS multiplicative_expr
   42              | multiplicative_expr

   43 multiplicative_expr: multiplicative_expr MUL unary_expr
   44                    | multiplicative_expr DIV unary_expr
   45                    | unary_expr

   46 unary_expr: NOT unary_expr
   47           | MINUS unary_expr
   48           | primary_expr

   49 primary_expr: ID
   50             | NUM_INT
   51             | NUM_DOUBLE
   52             | STRING_LITERAL
   53             | TRUE_LIT
   54             | FALSE_LIT
   55             | LPAREN expr RPAREN


